34748,(34748) The name of Abu Bakra: Nafi’ bin Al-Harith.
34749,(34749) The name of Abu Hurairah: Abd Shams.
34750,(34750) And Abu Talha Al-Ansari: Zayd bin Sahl.
34751,(34751) And Abu Burda bin Nayar: Hani bin Nayar.
