34880,"(34880) Abu Al-Hassan, from whom Amr bin Murra narrated, is: Hilal bin Yasaf."
34881,(34881) Abu Yafour Al-Abdi: Waqdan Al-Akbar.
34882,(34882) Abu Yafour Al-Amiri: Abdul Rahman bin Ubaid.
34883,"(34883) Abu Thabit, from whom Abu Yafour narrated: Aiman."
34884,(34884) Abu Al-Sha’atha’: Jabir bin Zaid.
34885,"(34885) Abu Hazim, from whom Ismail narrated: We are tested."
34886,(34886) Some of them said: Abu Salamah bin Abdul Rahman: Abdullah bin Abdul Rahman.
34887,"(34887) Abu Al-Muhallab, the companion of Awf: Omar bin Muawiyah, and some of them said: Abd al-Rahman bin Muawiyah."
34888,(34888) Abu Muharib: Muslim bin Amr.
34889,(34889) Abu Al-Khalil: Saleh.
34890,"(34890) Abu Al-Aliyah Al-Kufi, from whom Abu Ishaq narrated: Abdullah bin Salamah Al-Hamdani."
34891,(34891) Abu Al-Ashhab: Jafar bin Hayyan.
34892,(34892) Abu Hilal Al-Rasibi: Muhammad bin Sulaym.
34893,(34893) Abu Al-Mu’tamir: Yazid bin Taman.
34894,(34894) And Al-Masoudi: Abdul Rahman bin Abdullah bin Utba.
34895,(34895) And Abu Al-Umays: Utba bin Abdullah.
34896,(34896) Abu Sahl’s name: Awf bin Abi Jamila.
34897,(34897) Abu Ja`far al-Khutmi: Umair ibn Yazid.
34898,(34898) Abu Tamim Al-Jishani: Abdullah bin Malik.
34899,"(34899) Abu Wahhab Al-Jishani, his name: Daylam."
34900,"(34900) Abu Hariz, name: Abdullah bin Hussein."
34901,"(34901) Abu Fakhita, client of Ibn Hubaira: Sa`id bin Alaqiya."
34902,"(34902) Abu Raja’, from whom Shu’abi narrated, and Ibn Ali: Muhammad bin Saif."
34903,"(34903) Abu Al-Mu’tamir, companion of Ismail bin Abi Khaled, his name: Hanash."
34904,"(34904) And I heard someone mentioning that Abu Hamza, from whom Ismail bin Abi Khaled narrated: Saad bin Obaidah"
34905,"(34905) Al-Bahi, from whom Al-Suddi and Ismail bin Abi Khalid narrated, his name: Abdullah."
34906,"(34906) Ibn Abi Najih, his name: Abdullah."
34907,"(34907) And the one from whom Ata’ bin Al-Sa’ib Abu Muslim narrated, his name is: Al-Aghar."
34908,"(34908) Abu Abdullah Al-Barrad, his name: Salem."
34909,"(34909) Abu Musa, from whom Rashid bin Saad narrated, his name is: Yahnas."
34910,(34910) Al-Amash: Suleiman bin Mihran.
34911,"(34911) Abu Kathir, who narrated on the authority of Abu Hurairah, his name: Yazid bin Abdul Rahman bin Udhain Al-Sahimiyya."
34912,(34912) Abu Zumail: Simak Al-Hanafi.
34913,"(34913) Abu Al-Najashy, servant of Rafi’ bin Khadij, his name: Ata’."
34914,(34914) Abu Kudayna: Yahya bin Al-Muhallab.
34915,(34915) Abu Tahya’s name: Hakim bin Saad.
34916,"(34916) Abu Yazid, from whom Sufyan narrated: Waqi ibn Iyas."
34917,(34917) Abu Khaled Al-Dalani: Yazid bin Abdul Rahman.
34918,"(34918) Abu Al-Furat, from whom Abu Hayyan narrated: Shaddad bin Abi Al-Aliyah."
34919,(34919) Abu Talq: Adi bin Hanzala.
34920,"(34920) Abu Salman, the owner of Mas’ar, his name: Yazid."
34921,"(34921) Al-Hazzaz from whom Abdullah narrated, his name is: Hani’."
34922,"(34922) The name of Abu Umar, the companion of Ibn al-Hanafiyyah: Dinar, the client of Bishr ibn Ghalib."
34923,(34923) The name of Abu Sinan Al-Asadi: Wahhab bin Abdullah.
34924,"(34924) Abu Ayyash al-Zarqi, name: Zaid."
34925,"(34925) Umm Sulayman bin Amr bin Al-Ahwas, her name: Umm Jundub."
34926,(34926) Abu Saeed Al-Ahmasi: Al-Mukhariq bin Abdullah.
34927,(34927) Abu Harun Al-Abdi: Amara bin Juwayn.
34928,(34928) Abu Al-Ubaidin: Muawiyah bin Sabrah bin Husayn.
34929,(34929) The name of Abu Iyadh is: Amr bin Al-Aswad Al-Ansi.
34930,(34930) The name of Abu Idris Al-Murabibi is a bracelet.
34931,(34931) Abu Qatada al-Adawi: Tamim bin Nazir.
34932,(34932) Abu Hubaira: Harith bin Malik.
34933,(34933) Abu Hubira: Yahya bin Abbad Al-Ansari.
34934,"(34934) Abu Al-Jawzai, his name: Aws bin Abdullah Al-Ruba’i."
34935,(34935) Abu Ad-Dama’a: Qarfa ibn Bahis.
34936,(34936) Abu Hammam: Al-Walid bin Qais Al-Sakouni.
34937,"(34937) Abu Ibrahim Al-Ansari, they say: He is Abdullah bin Abi Qatada."
34938,(34938) The name of the father of Aaron Al-Ghanawi: Ibrahim bin Al-Ala.
34939,(34939) The name of Abu Marthad al-Ghanawi: Kannaz bin Husayn.
34940,(34940) Abu Idris Al-Khawlani: God forbid.
34941,(34941) Abu Ghallab’s name: Yunus bin Jubayr.
34942,"(34942) The name of Abu Al-Aliyah Al-Baraa’: Kulthum, a client of Quraysh."
34943,"(34943) The name of Abu al-Jahm: Subaih, from whom our companions narrated."
34944,"(34944) Abu Qadamah, from whom Simmak narrated, his name: Al-Nu’man bin Hamid."
34945,"(34945) Abu Israel Al-Absi, his name: Ismail bin Ishaq."
34946,"(34946) Abu Malik Al-Ash’ari, his name: Amr."
34947,"(34947) Ibn Hawalal, his name: Abdullah."
34948,"(34948) Umm Al-Rih is the daughter of Sali’, her name is Al-Rabab."
34949,"(34949) Abu Zaid Al-Ansari, whose name is: Amr bin Akhtab."
34950,(34950) The name of Abu Omar Al-Bahrani: Yahya bin Ubaid.
34951,(34951) The name of Abu Balj al-Fazari: Yahya bin Abi Sulaym.
34952,(34952) The name of Abu Al-Jalas: Uqba bin Sayyar.
34953,"(34953) The name of Abu Hammam, from whom Ali bin Ata’ narrated: Abdullah bin Yassar."
34954,"(34954) The name of Abu Qaz’a, from whom Hammad bin Salamah narrated: Suwayd bin Hujar Al-Balili."
34955,(34955) Ibn Munabbih’s name: Wahhab.
34956,(34956) Umm al-Fadl’s name: Lubab bint al-Harith.
34957,(34957) The name of Abu Na’amah Al-Hanafi: Qais bin Abaya.
34958,(34958) Abu Naamah Al-Shaqri: The servant of his Lord.
34959,(34959) Abu Aqeel: Bashir bin Uqba.
34960,(34960) Abu Twala: Abdullah bin Abdul Rahman bin Muammar.
34961,(34961) Abu Maudud: Abdul Aziz bin Abi Suleiman.
34962,"(34962) The name of Abu Firas, the servant of Amr bin Al-Aas: Yazid bin Rabah."
34963,"(34963) Abu Al-Zinba’, from whom Abu Hayyan narrated: Sadiqah bin Salih."
34964,(34964) The name of Abu Muawiyah: Muhammad bin Khazim.
34965,(34965) The name of Abu Al-Ahwas: Salam bin Sulaym.
34966,(34966) The name of Abu Al-Muhazam: Yazid bin Sufyan.
34967,(34967) The name of Abu Abdullah Al-Jadali: Abd bin Abd.
34968,"(34968) Abu Khaled Al-Walbi died in the year 100, and his name was: Hurmuz."
34969,"(34969) They mention that Saeed bin Al-Musayyab said: I was born two years ago after Omar, may God be pleased with him."
34970,"(34970) And they mention: Abu Ayyub al-Azdi, the companion of Qatadah, was Yahya bin Malik."
34971,(34971) The name of Umm Hani’ bint Abi Talib is Hind.
34972,"(34972) And Umm Hakim bint Al-Zubayr, her name: Dabaa’."
34973,(34973) And Abu Hamid Al-Sa’idi: Abdul Rahman bin Saad bin Al-Miqdam.
34974,"(34974) Umm Khalid bint Khaled, her name: Umm bint Khalid."
34975,"(34975) And they mention: The name of Abu Ma’abad, the client of Ibn Abbas, is Nafith."
34976,"(34976) And they mention: The name of Abu Yahya al-Araj is: Musa’da, the client of Muadh ibn Afra’."
34977,(34977) And they mention: The name of Umm Atiyya Al-Ansariyya is her relative.
34978,(34978) Abu Ammar Al-Hamdani: Oraib bin Humaid.
34979,"(34979) Abu Nawfal bin Abi Aqrab, whose name is: Muawiyah bin Muslim bin Abi Aqrab."
34980,(34980) Abu Sarmah: Malik bin Qais Al-Qari.
34981,(34981) Abu Al-Sawda: Amr bin Imran.
34982,(34982) And I was informed that the name of Abu Qais bin Abi Hazim is Awf bin Al-Harith.
34983,(34983) And I was informed that the name of Ibn Murabba’ is Zayd bin Murabba’.
34984,(34984) The name of Abu Tha’labah Al-Khushani is: Lasher bin Hamid.
34985,(34985) The name of Abu Muslim Al-Khawlani is: Abdullah bin Thub.
34986,"(34986) Al-Haytham bin Al-Aswad, nickname: Abu Al-Aryan."
34987,(34987) And a peacock whose nickname is: Abu Abd al-Rahman.
34988,"(34988) Aqeel bin Abi Talib, nickname: Abu Yazid."
34989,(34989) Salman Al-Farisi: Abu Abdullah.
34990,(34990) Sahib: Abu Yahya.
34991,"(34991) Ata bin Abi Maimunah, nickname: Abu Muadh."
34992,"(34992) Naeem bin Ziyad, from whom Amer narrated, his nickname is: Abu Yahya."
34993,"(34993) Musa bin Yazid bin Muwaib, nickname: Abu Abdul Rahman."
34994,(34994) Musa bin Talha: Abu Issa.
34995,"(34995) Muslim bin Subaih, his nickname: Abu Al-Duhahi."
34996,"(34996) The name of Abi Atiyya, the companion of Ali bin Al-Aqmar: Amr bin Abi Jundub."
34997,"(34997) Yazid, from whom Imran narrated, his nickname is Abu Al-Buzari."
34998,(34998) Zaid bin Suhan: Abu Aisha.
34999,(34999) Muwarriq Al-Ijli’s nickname: Abu Al-Mu’tamir.
35000,"(35,000) Amr bin Abbasa: Abu Najih."
35001,(35001) It was mentioned that Abu Al-Jawzai was killed at the age of eighty-three in Al-Jamajam.
35002,"(35002) And Uqba bin Abdul Ghafir,"
35003,(35003) and Abdullah bin Ghalib.
35004,(35004) It was mentioned: Mutarrif is twenty years older than Al-Hasan.
35005,(35005) His brother Abu Al-Ala was ten years older than Al-Hasan.
35006,(35006) Mutarrif died after the sweeping plague.
35007,"(35007) Abu Nadhrah, Abu Majlaz, and Bakr died a little before Al-Hasan."
35008,(35008) It was mentioned that: Al-Hasan was ten years older than Muhammad.
35009,"(35009) Abdullah bin Idris told us, on the authority of Muhammad bin Ishaq, on the authority of Al-Zuhri, who said: When I met Ubaidullah It is as if I will cause a sea to explode with it."
35010,"(35010) Abu Dawud told us, on the authority of Shu’bah, on the authority of Abd al-Malik ibn Misra, who said: Al-Dahhak did not meet Ibn Abbas. He met Saeed bin Jubayr with Al-Ray, so he took the interpretation from him."
35011,"(35011) Ibn Uyaynah told us, on the authority of Amr, on the authority of Al-Hasan bin Muhammad; Fatima was buried at night."
35012,"(35012) Shababah bin Suwar narrated to us, Sulaiman bin Al-Mughirah narrated to us, on the authority of Hamid bin Hilal, on the authority of Abdullah bin Foolishly, he said: Abdullah bin Salam passed through a land next to him and said: This is the head of forty years, and he will be there. Peace be upon him, he said: The group of Muawiyah was at the beginning of the forty."
35013,"(35013) Abu Dawud told us, on the authority of Shu`ba, he said: Mashash told me, he said: I asked Al-Dahhak: Have you seen Ibn Abbas? He said: No."
35014,"(35014) Ismail Ibn Aliyah told us, on the authority of Mansour Ibn Abd al-Rahman, on the authority of al-Sha’bi, who said: Abu Bakr died. And Omar, and Ali, and they did not compile the Qur’an."
35015,"(35015) Ibn Aliyah told us, on the authority of Yunus, he said: When Sa`id ibn Abi Al-Hasan died, Al-Hasan found him very sad. Severe, so he spoke about that, and he said: I did not hear God criticizing Jacob for sadness, and Al-Hasan said: When Utba bin Masoud died Ibn Masoud found Ali, and when he was spoken to about that, he said: By God, when God has decreed what He has decreed, I do not like that I invited him. So he answered me."
35016,"(35016) Yahya bin Adam narrated to us, Israel narrated to us, on the authority of Abu Ishaq, he said: I narrated; Qais bin Saad bin Abbada served the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, for two years."
35017,"(35017) Ubayd Allah narrated to us, saying: Israel informed us, on the authority of Abu Ishaq, on the authority of a man who narrated to him; That Abu Bakr walked around Abdullah bin Al-Zubayr in a rag, and he was the first child born into Islam. (Ibn Abi Asim 121)"
35018,"(35018) Zayd bin Harun told us, Hammam told us, he said: The blind Abu Dawud entered upon his commanders, and when he came out, they said: For him: This is narrated on the authority of the eighteenth of Badriya. He said: This was a beggar before the one who swept away, not tempted by anything. This, by God, Al-Hasan and Sa’id bin Al-Musayyab did not narrate to us on the authority of Badri, except Sa’id, on the authority of Sa’d."
35019,"(35019) Ghandar narrated to us, on the authority of Shuabi, on the authority of Amr ibn Murra, who said: I said to Abu Ubaidah: Was Abdullah with the Prophet? May God bless him and grant him peace during the night of the jinn? He said: No."
35020,"(35020) Ali bin Ubaid told us, on the authority of Al-Amash, on the authority of Ibrahim, he said: This was mentioned to your scholars, and he said: I wished Our friend was with him. (Muslim 333)"
35021,"(35021) Hussein bin Ali told us, on the authority of Fudail, on the authority of Hisham, who said: I said: How many of the companions of the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, had May God bless him and grant him peace? He said: Thirty and a hundred. He said: I said: How much did Ibn Sirin realize? He said: Thirty."
35022,"(35022) Abu Asama told us, on the authority of Ismail, on the authority of Amer, he said: Abdul Rahman bin Abza told me, he said: I prayed with Omar Ali Zainab, she was the first of the wives of the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, to die after the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace."
35023,"(35023) Abu Asama told us, on the authority of Hisham, on the authority of his father, he said: Khadija died before the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, left. May God bless him and grant him peace, he returned to Medina within two years, or close to that, then he married Aisha, who was six years old, and built She is nine years old."
35024,"(35024) Yahya bin Adam narrated to us, on the authority of Sharik, who said: I heard Abu Ishaq say: I was born two years after the birth of a woman. Othman, Sharik said: We buried him in the days of the Kharijites."
35025,"(35025) Muhammad bin Abdullah Al-Asadi narrated to us, Hibban narrated to us, on the authority of Mujalid, on the authority of Al-Sha’bi, he said: Abu Musa wrote to Omar: Indeed, there has come to us books whose date we do not know, so he dated them, so he consulted the companions of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, and said Some of them: date the sending of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, and some of them said: date the death of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace. And peace be upon him, and Omar said: I date to Muhajir of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, for Muhajir of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace A difference between truth and falsehood, so he dated."
35026,(35026) Abu Bakr Al-Siddiq: Abdullah.
35027,(35027) Abdullah bin Al-Zubair: Abu Bakr.
35028,(35028) Omar bin Al-Khattab: Abu Hafs.
35029,"(35029) Othman bin Affan: Abu Abdullah, and his nickname is: Abu Amr."
35030,(35030) Hudhaifa: Abu Abdullah.
35031,(35031) Al-Zubayr bin Al-Awwam: Abu Abdullah.
35032,"(35032) Jarir bin Abdullah: Abu Abdullah, and some of them said: Abu Amr."
35033,(35033) Abdullah bin Masoud: Abu Abdul Rahman.
35034,(35034) Ibn Omar: Abu Abdul Rahman.
35035,(35035) Ali bin Abi Talib: Abu Al-Hassan.
35036,(35036) Saad bin Abi Waqqas: Abu Ishaq.
35037,(35037) Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib: Abu Al-Fadl.
35038,(35038) Abdullah bin Abbas: Abu Abbas.
35039,(35039) Ubayy bin Ka’b: Abu Al-Mundhir.
35040,(35040) Imran bin Al-Hussein: Abu Nujaid.
35041,(35041) Khaled bin Zaid: Abu Ayyoub.
35042,(35042) Uqba bin Amr: Abu Masoud.
35043,(35043) Anas bin Malik: Abu Hamza.
35044,(35044) Al-Hasan bin Ali: Abu Muhammad.
35045,(35045) Al-Ash’ath bin Qays: Abu Muhammad.
35046,(35046) Al-Hussein bin Ali: Abu Abdullah.
35047,(35047) Al-Miqdad bin Al-Aswad: Abu Amr.
35048,(35048) Hamza bin Abdul Muttalib: Abu Ammarah.
35049,(35049) Muawiyah: Abu Abd al-Rahman.
35050,(35050) Abdul Rahman bin Awf: Abu Muhammad.
35051,(35051) Khaled bin Al-Walid: Abu Suleiman.
35052,(35052) Ammar: Abu Al-Yaqzan.
35053,(35053) Talha bin Ubaid Allah: Abu Muhammad.
35054,(35054) Al-Mughirah bin Shu’ba: Abu Abdullah.
35055,"(35055) Saad bin Malik,"
35056,(35056) And Amr bin Harith: Abu Saeed.
35057,(35057) Amr bin Al-Aas: Abu Abdullah.
35058,(35058) Marwan bin Al-Hakam: Abu Abdul-Malik.
35059,(35059) Shurayh: Abu Umayyah.
35060,(35060) Suwayd bin Ghafla: Abu Umayyah.
35061,(35061) Al-Aswad bin Yazid: Abu Amr.
35062,(35062) Alqamah: Abu Shibl.
35063,(35063) Stolen: Abu Aisha.
35064,(35064) Ibn al-Hanafiyyah: Abu al-Qasim.
35065,(35065) Saeed bin Al-Musayyab: Abu Muhammad.
35066,(35066) Abdullah bin Maqil: Abu Al-Walid.
35067,(35067) Saeed bin Jubayr: Abu Abdullah.
35068,(35068) Mujahid: Abu Al-Hajjaj.
35069,(35069) Ata bin Abi Rabah: Abu Muhammad.
35070,(35070) Iyas bin Muawiyah: Abu Wathili.
